  <UMW_BellCast.label>钟铸锤头</UMW_BellCast.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is cast solid like a bell. A clean strike rings a resonance through armor and bone, briefly stunning the target. -->
  <UMW_BellCast.description>锤头如钟一般整体铸成。干净利落的一击会令共振穿透护甲与骨骼，短暂击晕目标。</UMW_BellCast.description>

